OL,3,A'Time is up': Minister warns media
OL,4,Aindustry to take abuse seriously in
OL,5,Awake of Brand case
OL,6,
OL,7,FAbuse in the media industry is probably
OL,8,Fstill happening as organisations are
OL,9,Fnot doing enough to protect women, the
OL,10,Fculture secretary has warned in the
OL,11,Fwake of Russell Brand's conviction.
OL,13,FLisa Nandy told the BBC's Sunday with
OL,14,FLaura Kuenssberg programme: "Time is
OL,15,Fup, it really is time for the media
OL,16,Findustry to take this seriously."
OL,18,FShe added that since entering
OL,19,Fgovernment, "many people" from within
OL,20,Fthe industry had reached out to her "to
OL,21,Fallege that things have happened to
OL,22,Fthem".
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
